      "role": "user",
      "content": "i did the right thing but now i have nothing. i lost my job, my friends won't even look at me, and everyone just treats me like i'm the problem for speaking up. it feels like i traded my entire life just to be right about something that doesn't even matter to anyone else. what was even the point of any of it?",
