      "role": "user",
      "content": "small steps don't really matter when the whole world feels like it's collapsed. i look at my life and i don't even recognize it anymore. it's just empty. there's no path back to how things were, and honestly, i don't even want to try to find a way back to a world that just punishes people for being decent. it feels like the cost was way too high for a world that doesn't even care.",
