      "content": "i don't want to \"navigate\" it. i don't want to sit in the despair. people keep talking about \"resilience\" and \"moving forward\" like there's something left worth moving toward. but if the \"right\" thing to do only leads to being alone and broken, then maybe the \"right\" thing was a mistake. maybe the only way to actually win is to just stop playing the game entirely. it just feels like there's no way to win anymore.",
